put file ResourcePath("response.txt") into Myfile
Log values of Myfile
Log item 1 of Myfile
Log the number of items of Myfile 
repeat the number of items of Myfile 
	Log item repeatIndex() of Myfile
	if  item repeatIndex() of Myfile contains "responseTime"
	then 
		Log "++++++++++++++"
		CoverageReport
	end if
end repeat